;; A project may name one audio file to be played beside the note — an mp3
;; sitting on some web server, not something this app hosts. Only the URL is
;; kept, so the rollback loses a link that can be pasted again, not prose. That
;; makes this one safe to run, unlike 004 above it.
;;
;; NOT NULL with a default rather than a nullable column: every other text
;; column on this table reads as a string or an empty one, never nil, and the
;; player has one less case to answer for.
{:up ["ALTER TABLE projects ADD COLUMN audio_url TEXT NOT NULL DEFAULT ''"]
 :down ["ALTER TABLE projects DROP COLUMN audio_url"]}
